node_modules/

# The playable Village, built into the site by the `prebuild` (scripts/build-village.mjs).
# Generated from packages/village-client + examples/the-village.storylets, so it is
# never committed: 4.5 MB of build output with a source of truth two directories away.
public/village/
# The playable Hamlet, likewise (scripts/build-hamlet.mjs): two engines, one build, never committed.
public/hamlet/
# The What's new page, written from the changelogs by scripts/whats-new.mjs before each build.
src/content/docs/whats-new.md
